assignment copy:
  holder weak, copy strong
  after undef $t: holder defined=1, copy defined=1
  DESTROY
  after undef copy: holder defined=0
list assignment copy:
  copy strong
  holder defined=1
  DESTROY
shift of a weak element (the element SV itself leaves the array):
  held element weak same_sv=1, shifted copy strong
  DESTROY
  after death: held element defined=0 strong
sub return of a weak lexical:
  returned strong
  holder defined=1
  DESTROY
hash value copied out:
  copy strong, values copy strong
  element defined=1
  DESTROY
end
